## Security Considerations
- Only allow exceptions with proper security review
- Apply stricter scrutiny to security-related rule exceptions
- Require additional approvals for security-sensitive exceptions
- Audit all exception approvals and implementations
- Never allow exceptions for critical security rules
- Track security impact of all exceptions
- Regular security review of active exceptions
- Immediate revocation for exceptions with security implications

## Testing Requirements
- Test all code with exceptions to verify functionality
- Verify exceptions don't bypass critical validations
- Test alternative approaches for viability
- Document test results in exception requests
- Ensure test coverage remains high despite exceptions
- Verify exception expiration doesn't break functionality
- Test for proper exception documentation compliance

## Maintenance
- Monthly review of active exceptions
- Quarterly compliance metrics report
- Exception expiration notifications (7 days prior)
- Automatic removal of expired exceptions
- Documentation updates for common exceptions
- Team training on exception process
- Feedback collection on rule effectiveness
- Rule modification proposals based on exception patterns

